### ==========================================
### LOGIN DEL ADMINISTRADOR
### ==========================================
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Francisco Castro",
    "password": "12345"
}


### ==========================================
### MODIFICAR UN USUARIO
### ==========================================
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/users/Giovanni
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.session.authorizationToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "displayName": "Giovanni Monti"
}